---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale hasEnded == true
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: sale active
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> [*]: position.investedCapital += amount, totalCapitalInvested += amount, emit Invested

    note right of q_check_ended
        INV-001: no time restriction, only manual end check
        INV-002: deposit represents maximum allocation commitment
    end note

    note right of q_check_min
        INV-003: signature from authorized Legion signer required
        INV-004: minimum investment threshold enforced
    end note
